## Tier taxonomy: one home per fact

| Tier | Job | Does NOT belong there |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Root `AGENTS.md` | Always-loaded standing orders, layout, and commands (1–3 lines per rule, linking owners) | Worked examples, situational procedures, restated reference docs |
| `docs/AGENTS.md` | Tier boundaries, fact-to-home map, language mode, and budget policy | Subsystem internals, runbooks, historical decisions |
| `README.md` | Entry point: what the project does, quick start, layout map | Exhaustive references, changelog/history dumps |
| `docs/` | Current-state guides, architecture, and reference contracts | Unimplemented plans, failed experiments, review history |
